 to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids. In 2025 that pair ran 42% of normal on the middle, while July to August ran 128%. So far in 2026, January to February and February to March each sit at 20% of normal on the middle. Grid 27426 had its driest year in 2012 at 55%.</p>"}
